  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"172\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"170\">About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"662\">Commercial Cleaning Depot is a leading U.S.-based distributor of high-performance commercial cleaning and restoration equipment. We serve contractors, facilities managers, government agencies, and institutional buyers with products that include carpet extractors, air scrubbers, portable air conditioners, heat pumps, dehumidifiers, steam cleaners, and more. All equipment is factory-direct and rigorously vetted for quality and performance—ideal for heavy-duty commercial use.</p><p data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"807\">We are an authorized dealer for trusted American manufacturers like EDIC, US Steam, XPOWER, Abatement Technologies, Therma-Kleen, and more.</p><hr data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"812\"><h3 data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"848\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"846\">What makes us different:</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"1158\"><li data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"900\"><p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"900\">🚚&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"871\">Free shipping</strong> across the continental USA</p></li><li data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"991\"><p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"991\">🧾 <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"968\">No sales tax</strong> (outside of Wyoming)</p></li><li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1048\"><p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1048\">🏷️ <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1024\">Factory-direct pricing</strong> with volume discounts</p></li><li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1101\"><p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1101\">🧑‍💼&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1084\">Expert customer support</strong>, 7 days a week</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1346\">Our curated product line focuses on durability, compliance, and industrial strength, making our catalog a go-to for professionals who need equipment that performs day in and day out.</p><hr data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1351\"><h3 data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1385\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1600\">Earn up to 5% commission on high-ticket commercial equipment, with average order values often exceeding $1,500–$3,000+.</p><p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1600\"><br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\">💰 Some top-performing affiliates are generating $100–$300 per referral sale.</p><p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1618\">We also offer:</p><ul data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1725\"><li data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1645\"><p data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1645\">30-day tracking cookie</p></li><li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1693\"><p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1693\">Weekly payouts via PayPal or bank transfer</p></li><li data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1725\"><p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1725\">Dedicated affiliate support</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\"><h3 data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1760\"><strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1758\">How to promote us:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1880\">Whether you're a content creator, B2B blogger, email marketer, or part of an industry network, you can promote us by:</p><ul data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2161\"><li data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1944\"><p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\">Featuring our top products in blogs and comparison articles</p></li><li data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2024\"><p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2024\">Sharing links through trade forums, cleaning contractor groups, or LinkedIn</p></li><li data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2094\"><p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2094\">Recommending our equipment in “top tool” roundups or case studies</p></li><li data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2161\"><p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2161\">Running paid ads or retargeting traffic to niche landing pages</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2260\">We’re happy to help you with creatives, product links, and SEO-friendly landing pages on request.</p><hr data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2265\"><h3 data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2295\"><strong data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2293\">Other information:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2472\">We regularly add new products in fast-growing B2B segments like mold remediation, HVAC cooling, and floor restoration. Affiliates will always have fresh content to promote.</p><p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2544\">Need help or have questions? Our team is here to support your success.</p><p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2628\">Let’s grow together—apply now to become a Commercial Cleaning Depot affiliate!</p></div>",
